  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4292</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4301</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kunzite&gt;、よく無事で……
こうして話をするのも
何年ぶりでしょう……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm so glad you are well, &lt;Kunzite&gt;.
How many years has it been
since we last spoke?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4816</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4302</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>５３億７２１０万１１秒……
約１７０年ぶりです、リチア様</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It has been 5,372,100,011 seconds.
Approximately 170 years, Master Lithia.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4940</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4303</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>貴方はインカローズとの戦いで
死んでしまったと思っていた……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I was convinced you had perished
in your battle against Incarose...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>5152</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4304</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……申し訳ありません。
自分はクリードを
とめられませんでした</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Please accept my most sincere apology.
I was unable to stop Creed.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>5412</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4305</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>いいえ。貴方がいなかったら
わたくしは……&lt;Kohaku&gt;を
殺していました……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Don't apologize.
If you hadn't intervened, I...
surely would have taken &lt;Kohaku&gt;'s life.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>5876</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4306</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どれほど感謝しても足りません。
……ありがとう、&lt;Kunzite&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No words could ever express
the extent of my gratitude.
Thank you, &lt;Kunzite&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
